@startuml
[*] --> Empty : new Editor()
Empty --> State1 : type("Hello")
State1 --> State1Saved : save(), History.push
State1Saved --> State2 : type(" World")
State2 --> State2Saved : save(), History.push
State2Saved --> State3 : type("!!!")
State3 --> State2 : restore(History.pop())
State2 --> State1 : restore(History.pop())
State1 --> [*] : demo ends
note bottom of State2Saved
  States are the Editor content values from
  MementoDemo.main(); saved states have a
  matching Memento on the History stack.
end note
@enduml
